      "seed": 344170172,
      "version": 1816,
      "versionNonce": 975748100,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782062204305,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Idea 4: Multiple Sources of Stories, each with their own logic. Each source is called a \"Candidate Generator\".\n\n1. Popularity: Top K stories by number of likes/comments filtered by time and user cohort\n2. Connected Content: Use the graph between user/story/group connections to find related stories\n3. Exploration: Inject a few stories outside a user's expected interests to identify new ones\n4. Semantic: Match user and story by explicit search\n    a. Text Search: Match user interest string terms with content string terms.\n        Eg. user interested in `travel`, find content featuring `travel` and pre-identified terms`flights`, `cruise` etc.)\n    b. Embedding Search: Our first encounter with ML",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Idea 4: Multiple Sources of Stories, each with their own logic. Each source is called a \"Candidate Generator\".\n\n1. Popularity: Top K stories by number of likes/comments filtered by time and user cohort\n2. Connected Content: Use the graph between user/story/group connections to find related stories\n3. Exploration: Inject a few stories outside a user's expected interests to identify new ones\n4. Semantic: Match user and story by explicit search\n    a. Text Search: Match user interest string terms with content string terms.\n        Eg. user interested in `travel`, find content featuring `travel` and pre-identified terms`flights`, `cruise` etc.)\n    b. Embedding Search: Our first encounter with ML",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "tMvWH7T5nwK-72VwwSzkO",
