      "y": 4259.272554563142,
      "width": 1049.05517578125,
      "height": 160,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2B",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1430926524,
      "version": 2548,
      "versionNonce": 820847108,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782241403654,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Where do these datapoints live?\n\n1. Popularity: Top K stories are tracked for the last few hours or days (eg. 7d) and stored in a database like cassandra or postgres \n2. Connected Content: Store users and stories in a graph. Use this to get connected content.\n3. Exploration: Could be from various sources. Find content that users may find interesting, could even be random niche ones.\n4. Semantic: \n    a. Text Search: Elastic Search to match terms\n    b. Embedding Search: Pinecone or Milvus for embedding nearest-neighbor lookups",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Where do these datapoints live?\n\n1. Popularity: Top K stories are tracked for the last few hours or days (eg. 7d) and stored in a database like cassandra or postgres \n2. Connected Content: Store users and stories in a graph. Use this to get connected content.\n3. Exploration: Could be from various sources. Find content that users may find interesting, could even be random niche ones.\n4. Semantic: \n    a. Text Search: Elastic Search to match terms\n    b. Embedding Search: Pinecone or Milvus for embedding nearest-neighbor lookups",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
