      "index": "b2x",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1070239108,
      "version": 1061,
      "versionNonce": 1663656580,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1782326837087,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Features are properties of an entity like a user or story. (eg. story = num_likes_3day, user = avg_time_spent_7day). They are the inputs to a model alongside context. \nThese are either computed live and precomputed depending on the use-case and cost.\n\nThere are different kinds of features including, numerical (eg. story_age) and categorical features (eg. story_ids liked by user in last week). I'll not go into the details here as there are many great tutorials on features. \n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Features are properties of an entity like a user or story. (eg. story = num_likes_3day, user = avg_time_spent_7day). They are the inputs to a model alongside context. \nThese are either computed live and precomputed depending on the use-case and cost.\n\nThere are different kinds of features including, numerical (eg. story_age) and categorical features (eg. story_ids liked by user in last week). I'll not go into the details here as there are many great tutorials on features. \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
