      "originalText": "Closing Summary\n\n1. Walkthrough a live serving request\n2. Walkthrough offline / precompute actions\n3. Have we solved the problem?\n    a. Not fully. This space will keep evolving.\n    b. This improves the system from it's original scoring formula to an ML based ranking system.\n    c. There's a lot more to do including freshness, efficiency and other foundational improvements.",
